Disputes in administrative matters within the village's area of responsibilities;
Other civil disputes as prescribed by law.

Family Disputes
Family disputes include the following:
1. Disputes amongst family members with the exception of divorce in compliance
with the Civil Code;
2. Assets belonging to spouse such as initial (pre-marriage) assets and matrimonial
assets;
